--- leg 1: the hoisted value pass takes the lane geometry ---
lanes_hoisted: the optimized nest keeps the hoisted shape: true
lanes_hoisted: Grid (h, s, b) on .x, .y, .z and a 32-wide lane: true
lanes_hoisted: the Workgroup lane sits inside the serial key loop, past the preamble: true
lanes_hoisted: every cell of lanes_hoisted_o holds the serial order's exact value: true
lanes_hoisted: the emitted kernel binds the lane inside the serial loop: true
--- leg 2: a lane nest sharing its kernel with a plain nest keeps the plain plan ---
lanes_mixed: no lane geometry: true
lanes_mixed: the plain plans, Grid (h, s, b) x Workgroup e with the lane nest's h split: true
lanes_mixed: every cell of lanes_mixed_o holds the serial order's exact value: true
lanes_mixed: every cell of lanes_mixed_q holds the serial order's exact value: true
--- leg 3: a lane reading another lane's cell declines ---
lanes_mirror: no lane geometry: true
lanes_mirror: the plain plan, Grid (s, b) x Workgroup h: true
lanes_mirror: every cell of lanes_mirror_o holds the serial order's exact value: true
--- leg 4: a preamble holding an inlined reduction keeps the plain plan ---
lanes_scoped: the preamble holds the inlined loop: true
lanes_scoped: no lane geometry: true
lanes_scoped: the plain plan, Grid (s, b) x Workgroup h: true
--- leg 5: the rewritten attention's value pass, through the real pipeline ---
attention, stored scores: the lowering carries the hoisted value pass: true
attention, stored scores: the CPU preset schedules no lanes: true
attention, stored scores: a GPU segment schedules the value pass with lanes: true
attention, stored scores: the rewritten forward agrees with the composed one: true
attention, recomputed scores: the lowering carries the hoisted value pass: true
attention, recomputed scores: the CPU preset schedules no lanes: true
attention, recomputed scores: no GPU segment takes lanes (every lane would recompute the dot product): true
attention, recomputed scores: the rewritten forward agrees with the composed one: true
--- leg 6: the attention backward of a training step carries hardware geometry ---
fused D: the GPU pipeline emits its nest: true
fused D: every nest writing it runs under a Grid or Workgroup loop: true
fused dQ: the GPU pipeline emits its nest: true
fused dQ: every nest writing it runs under a Grid or Workgroup loop: true
fused dK: the GPU pipeline emits its nest: true
fused dK: every nest writing it runs under a Grid or Workgroup loop: true
fused dV: the GPU pipeline emits its nest: true
fused dV: every nest writing it runs under a Grid or Workgroup loop: true
composed dP: the GPU pipeline emits its nest: true
composed dP: every nest writing it runs under a Grid or Workgroup loop: true
fused dK: every nest writing it binds a Workgroup lane inside the serial query loop: true
fused dK: every nest writing it computes dp as a Workgroup_reduce over the lanes: true
the fused step's parameter gradients are not identically zero: true
the fused step's parameter gradients agree with the composed ones within 1e-4 relative: true
fused dV: every nest writing it binds a Workgroup lane inside the serial query loop: true
--- leg 7: lanes where per-lane recompute is costly ---
lanes_costly: alone in its kernel, the hoisted value pass still takes the lane geometry: true
lanes_costly: with the lanes off, no lane geometry: true
lanes_costly: with the lanes off, the plain plan, Grid (s, b) x Workgroup h: true
lanes_costly: every cell of lanes_costly_o holds the serial order's exact value: true
attention, costly lanes: a GPU segment schedules the value pass with lanes: true
training forward, costly lanes: the value pass is scheduled with lanes: true
fused dV, costly lanes: the GPU pipeline emits its nest: true
fused dV, costly lanes: every nest writing it runs under a Grid or Workgroup loop: true
fused dV, costly lanes: no nest writing it binds a lane inside the serial query loop: true
fused dV, costly lanes: every segment computing it computes dK too, merged off the lanes: true
fused dV, cut for its lanes: a segment computes it: true
fused dV, cut for its lanes: no segment computing it computes dK: true
auto where per-lane recompute is cheap cuts for the lanes: true
auto where it is not admits them without cutting: true
auto on an unmeasured device admits them without cutting: true
auto on the run's backend resolves to its measured mode: true
executed fused step: every segment computing dV computes dK beside it, on the device's mode (cut: both on their lanes; admitted: dV off the lanes): true
